摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: detect pasted secrets, store them in the credentials seam, and send [secret:REF] placeholders to the model.","id":"gh:1340090758","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-secret-paste","slug":"zhujiaqi/dsh-secret-paste","topics":["credential","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","secret"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: detect pasted secrets, store them in the credentials seam, and send [secret"},{"id":"p1s2","text":":REF] placeholders to the model."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-secret-paste"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A DeepSeek Harness plugin that detects secrets pasted into the composer, stores\n> them in the offi"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"cial credentials seam, and sends a `[secret:REF]` placeholder to\n> the model instead of the plaintex"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"t. The real value never reaches the message,\n> the session history, or any transcript."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🌐 中文：README.zh.md ｜ **English**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"You paste an API key or a token into the chat. Without protection it goes straight\nto the model and "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"into the session log — which is exactly where a secret should\nnever land. This plugin intercepts the"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" paste, stores the value in the official\nDSH credential seam (`~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml`, mode 0600)"},{"id":"p6s4","text":", and replaces it in\nthe draft with `[secret:REF]`. The model only ever sees the placeholder, and ca"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"n\nread the real value on demand through a dedicated tool."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Step | What happens |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Detect | `@sanity-labs/secret-scan` (1,100+ rules derived from gitleaks / TruffleHog) runs on the "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"pasted text. |\n| Store | The value is written with the official `credentials.set` Web API — no new s"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"erver route. |\n| Replace | The matched range becomes `[secret:PASTE_N]` in the draft. |\n| Resolve | "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"The model calls the `secret_resolve(ref)` tool when it actually needs the value. |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The plaintext value lives in exactly two places: (1) this tab's memory, and\n(2) `~/.dsh/.credentials"},{"id":"p10s2","text":".yaml` (mode 0600). Every other surface — the sent\nmessage, session history, transcripts — sees only"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"0). Every other surface — the sent\nmessage, session history, transcripts — sees only `[secret:REF]`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- A DeepSeek Harness **Web** profile (the examples use `web`).\n- The `dsh` CLI and `pnpm` on your `P"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ATH` (`dsh plugin` is a thin pnpm forwarder)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Install from the npm registry (recommended)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"What this command does:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Runs `pnpm add dsh-secret-paste` inside the profile directory.\n2. Installs the single runtime dep"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"endency (`@sanity-labs/secret-scan`).\n3. Because the package declares `dsh.bundle.patch`, it is auto"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"-registered in\n`dsh.profile.bundles` as a profile layer."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"No build step runs on install — the browser bundle is prebuilt and shipped."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Restart"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The server half (the `secret_resolve` tool) loads at boot, so restart the `dsh web`\nprocess after in"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"stalling, then force-refresh the browser tab\n(`Cmd+Shift+R` / `Ctrl+Shift+R`) to load the client bun"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ling, then force-refresh the browser tab\n(`Cmd+Shift+R` / `Ctrl+Shift+R`) to load the client bundle:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Verify"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **Settings → Plugins** lists `dsh-secret-paste`.\n- Paste a GitHub token (`ghp_...`) into the compo"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ser: it is immediately replaced\nby `[secret:PASTE_N]` and a chip appears."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Installing from an agent or in automation"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The exact same steps work when an AI agent or a CI job installs the plugin:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"1. `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-secret-paste`\n2. Restart `dsh web` (required for the `secret_re"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"solve` tool to register).\n3. Force-refresh the browser tab.\n4. Verify: paste `ghp_...` and expect `["},{"id":"p26s3","text":"secret:PASTE_N]`, or confirm the served\npage's `window.__DSH_BOOT__` contains a `dsh-secret-paste` e"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"t:PASTE_N]`, or confirm the served\npage's `window.__DSH_BOOT__` contains a `dsh-secret-paste` entry."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Auto-detect and hide"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Paste text that contains a high-confidence secret (`ghp_...`, `sk-proj-...`, JWT, …).\nIt is stored a"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"nd replaced with `[secret:PASTE_N]` immediately, and a chip shows:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> 🔒 Hidden · <rule> · PASTE_N · Undo"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Hover** the chip to reveal the value in a tooltip — no layout shift.\n- **Undo** restores the pla"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"intext while you are still drafting.\n- After you **send**, the chip stays visible but the undo butto"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"n disappears; once\nthe answer arrives, the chip is removed."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Medium confidence"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"`confidence === 'medium'` hits (e.g. a `Bearer <token>`) stay in the draft as-is\nand a \"Suspected se"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"cret\" chip asks you to confirm (Hide) or ignore (Ignore)."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Manual marking"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Formats the detector does not recognize (`ark-...`, some `sk-...`) are never\nguessed. Select the tex"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"t and use the \"Mark selection as secret\" action, then \"Hide & store\"."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Nested placeholders"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"A selection that already contains `[secret:REF]` can be wrapped again. The\n`secret_resolve` tool res"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"olves such chains recursively down to plaintext\n(cycles or missing inner refs return `found: false`)"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"lves such chains recursively down to plaintext\n(cycles or missing inner refs return `found: false`)."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Model side: `secret_resolve`"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"When the model needs the real value, it calls the `secret_resolve(ref)` tool:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- Returns `{ found, value, source }`.\n- Resolves nested placeholders recursively to plaintext.\n- The"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" value is **SENSITIVE**: the tool description instructs the model never to\necho, repeat, or write it"},{"id":"p40s3","text":" into a reply, a file, a command, or a tool argument."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- **Values never leak**: only `[secret:REF]` appears in the message, history, or\ntranscripts. Values"},{"id":"p42s2","text":" exist only in tab memory and the 0600 credential file.\n- **Detection is conservative**: `high` auto"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"-hides, `medium` waits for a confirm,\nand unknown formats are never guessed (manual marking is the f"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"allback).\n- **Collision-safe refs**: if a ref is already configured, the next free ref is\nused inste"},{"id":"p42s5","text":"ad of overwriting; the same value is stored once per session.\n- **No reveal endpoint**: the credenti"},{"id":"p42s6","text":"al seam reads value-free with no\nenumeration; after a refresh the in-memory value is gone and chips "},{"id":"p42s7","text":"do not persist.\n- **Use-time visibility (v1)**: `secret_resolve` brings the value into model\ncontext"},{"id":"p42s8","text":" only when the model asks for it."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Structure"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"MIT. `vendor/secret-scan.cjs` is the compiled `dist/index.cjs` of\n`@sanity-labs/secret-scan`\nv1.1.0 "},{"id":"p48s2","text":"(MIT), whose rules derive from\ngitleaks (MIT) and TruffleHog detectors;\nits license is preserved at "},{"id":"p48s3","text":"`vendor/secret-scan.LICENSE`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
